{"parse": {"title": "AFH-01", "pageid": 105738, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AFH-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/AFH-02\" title=\"AFH-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AFH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.98.9F.E6.98.9F.E5.A4.9C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"星星夜\">星星夜</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 星星夜</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Towards the Stars</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>再<span class=\"color-value\"></span>见<span class=\"color-value\"></span>午<span class=\"color-value\"></span>夜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>萤<span class=\"color-value\"></span>火<span class=\"color-value\"></span>虫<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192401</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jinbishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jinbishi\"><img alt=\"jinbishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/600px-Cg-jinbishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/900px-Cg-jinbishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-jinbishi.png/1200px-Cg-jinbishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅰ：</div><div>你看，我其实见过不少老实人……贾纳丹，我知道饥饿远比刑罚更折磨人，道德只在人们饱腹，居有定所，拥有尊严时才能算数。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>审问者语气温和，仿若安慰着一位不小心犯了错的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅰ：</div><div>有年轻人为了让老母亲不再饥肠辘辘，才敲破了窗户，敲破了柜台，敲破了别人的脑袋——我完全理解，我完全理解！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅰ：</div><div>你属于那种人吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对面，被拷在椅子上男人吸着鼻涕，仰起头，似乎打算就此倾诉自己所有的委屈与不甘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-565920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-565920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-565920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>呜呜……警官，您说得很对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人低下头，哽咽得无地自容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警官把手放在了男人颤抖的肩膀上，凑近他的耳旁，试探着询问了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅰ：</div><div>那么……那份钱去哪儿了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅰ：</div><div>当然了，还有你绑架的孩子，我们所有人都很关心她的去向——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人泣不成声，嘴边只能喃喃着溜出几个不清不楚的句子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅰ：</div><div>你说什么？再说一遍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警官弯下腰，把耳朵凑了过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而迎接他的，却并非更清楚的言语——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅰ：</div><div>——啊啊啊啊啊啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>牙齿撕咬着他的耳垂，渗出鲜血。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅰ：</div><div>松口！松口！你这个摩卢旁卡村的猪猡神秘学家！来人，快来人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鲜血从男人的牙缝间流出来。他已完全脱去了楚楚可怜的扮相，露出了令人恶寒的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>杂*，你以为我不知道你在想什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>痛苦的嚎叫声中，审讯室的门被一把踹开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅱ：</div><div>猪猡 ，把他放开！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闯进来的警官迅速从腰带间掏出一根黑色铁棒，狠狠捶在男人的肚子上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>呕……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突如其来的捶打，令他顿生呕吐感，终于松下了口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>咳咳咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>哈哈哈哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>受伤的警官双手按着鲜血淋漓的耳朵，喘着大气，被同事扶了出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只留他在审讯室中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>桌子上，报纸的失踪报道中，一位失踪孩子的名字赫然在目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:138%\">——“坎吉拉”。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-yindujiedao_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"yindujiedao_ye\"><img alt=\"yindujiedao_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-yindujiedao_ye.png/600px-Cg-yindujiedao_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-yindujiedao_ye.png/900px-Cg-yindujiedao_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-yindujiedao_ye.png/1200px-Cg-yindujiedao_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:122%\">六天前</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"126\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩子Ⅰ：</div><div>这次怎么搞得神神秘秘的……有什么事不能白天再说吗？哎哟——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个指关节化作榔头敲在了孩子的脑袋上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿贾尔：</div><div>嘘……小声点，可别被夏尔贾老师听到了！等进了大篷车再说。坎吉拉大姐一定是有什么重要的事情才特意选择这个时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩子Ⅱ：</div><div>可上次你也是这么说的，结果呢……你记错了时间，害我的屁股都被那只看门的大狗咬了个破洞！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿贾尔：</div><div>什么！我后来不是跟你换裤子了么！小心眼的家伙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子们推搡着，互相追逐，偶尔有大人经过身边，便缩起脖子，装作一副好学生的样子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜幕里，他们犹如瓜田里飞窜的地鼠，很快到达了目的地。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-luyingdi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"luyingdi_ye\"><img alt=\"luyingdi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/600px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/900px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小脚丫们在郊林中窸窸窣窣探索一阵，来到了废旧大篷车前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿贾尔：</div><div>坎吉拉大姐，坎吉拉大姐？你到了吗？喂喂……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"126\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩子Ⅰ：</div><div>唉，她又迟到……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“吭、吭、吭……吭”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>早已报废的大篷车，忽然犹如巨兽般响起了喘息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿贾尔：</div><div>是谁在车里面？！我、我警告你赶紧下来，那可是咱的地盘！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"126\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩子Ⅰ：</div><div>会不会是那个被到处通缉的杀人犯？咱们还是走吧……阿贾尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“吭、吭、吭……吭”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿贾尔：</div><div>再不出来，我可要放狗咬你了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿贾尔用胳臂肘暗戳了戳身边的伙伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伙伴茫然地用食指指了指自己的下巴，像是在示意“怎么又是我”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"126\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩子Ⅰ：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子俯低身子，让喉咙舒张，卷起舌头——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"126\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩子Ⅰ：</div><div>嘶嗷！汪、汪汪……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿贾尔：</div><div>听见没有！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但大篷车里的“入侵者”置若罔闻，反而又一次点起了火。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只是这一次——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“吭、吭、吭……吭”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“吭哧哧！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-307101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-307101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-307101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>……终于，终于成功了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿贾尔：</div><div>坎吉拉大姐，里面的是你啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子们赶忙围了过去，像围观一只巨象般，纷纷瞪大了眼睛，啧啧称奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿贾尔：</div><div>你是把你爸妈留给你的大篷车修好了吗？哇奥，你是从哪里学来的绝活？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>偌大的车门被打开了，钻出来的是一个相较之下雏鸟般瘦小的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>咳、咳咳……呛死我了，看来在修理店偷师的那小子没有骗我。这可是一笔划算的买卖！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>嘿，阿贾尔，你们来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿贾尔：</div><div>坎吉拉大姐，这就是你召集我们的原因吗！？我们终于也能开大篷车去抢那些大人的生意了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子们欢呼雀跃，却转眼被一盆凉水泼冷了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>不……你误会了，阿贾尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>我……打算开着这辆大篷车，离开摩卢旁卡村。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿贾尔：</div><div>！？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说服伙伴们并没有太难，可也难免唤起大伙内心一阵担忧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"613510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-613510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-613510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"613510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-613510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-613510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/HeadIconSmall-613510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-613510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿贾尔：</div><div>可那消息是真的吗？如果他们真的在这个国家的另一边儿，你的爸妈为什么不亲自来这里找你？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子们躺在草坪上，仰望着夜空，任由萤火虫在身边飞舞，却无心捕捉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-307101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-307101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-307101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>那个从火车上逃下来的小扒手，一眼就认出了我脚上的蛇形足环。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-307101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-307101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-307101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>他说在那辆火车的始发站，曾见过一模一样的妇人戴着一样的足环！他们也正在四处找自己失踪的女孩哩！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-luyingdi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"luyingdi_ye\"><img alt=\"luyingdi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/600px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/900px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从口袋掏出那张寻人启事，上面没有画像，只有一些笼统的外貌描述以及与自己大致相符的年龄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>以及，一只绘制的蛇形足环。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>或许……他们并不是抛弃了我，而是因为什么原因不小心把我忘记在了这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿贾尔：</div><div>坎吉拉大姐……我不知道，那小子也许说的不是实话呢？就算是真的，他们也许找的不是你呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩深呼了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>那我也要去亲眼确认！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿贾尔：</div><div>可如果真的是他们，你还会回来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>遮住月亮的云，更沉甸甸了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>当然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>因为……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>这里才是我的家呀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿贾尔：</div><div>……坎吉拉大姐，这个给你，这是今早我在车站的“收获”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩坐起来，从口袋掏出零零碎碎的纸币，放到了她身边巴掌大的树叶上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接着是第二个伙伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"126\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩子Ⅰ：</div><div>这是我今天替那些官员老爷爷擦鞋子赚的钱，他们可阔绰嘞！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩子Ⅱ：</div><div>还有我的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子们从口袋里掏出了一天的所得所获，那零散的，算不得多的，也压弯了树叶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到树叶再也盛不下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>可你们会饿肚子的呀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿贾尔：</div><div>嘿嘿，那不算什么。坎吉拉大姐，你可是要去外面的世界闯荡，没有点路费怎么行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>我……我会还给你们的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b8/HeadIconSmall-518901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"126\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩子Ⅰ：</div><div>哈哈哈……那当然，等你回来，我们可还是要收好多利息的哟！你的下半辈子都要当雇工给咱们干活嘞！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>好呀！你们这些坏家伙，原来打的是这个算盘！哼哼，到时候我连半张卢比都不会还你们！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-563001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">孩子Ⅱ：</div><div>你敢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伙伴一拥而上，挠着她的痒。他们在草坪上打着滚儿，嬉笑着，熨斗般抚平了草地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>风来了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-xingkong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"xingkong\"><img alt=\"xingkong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/600px-Cg-xingkong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/900px-Cg-xingkong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-xingkong.png/1200px-Cg-xingkong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>…………</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-luyingdi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"luyingdi_ye\"><img alt=\"luyingdi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/600px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/900px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身影蹒跚着晃入郊林，喘息着，摇摇欲坠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>咳、咳……到这里，那帮杂*应该就不会追上来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼前破破烂烂的大篷车正好是最佳的庇护处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他翻入篷车后部，手一滑，摔倒在座椅后方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而这只从陷阱逃出来的“熊”，已奄奄一息，无力再站起……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-565911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>呃……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>很快，他失去了最后的意识。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AFH-01"}}